{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827","id":4455121902,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7b-bcK","number":4827,"title":"[otp field] Prevent locked hidden autofill validation","user":{"login":"lunaxislu","id":102783842,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiBbYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102783842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu","html_url":"https://github.com/lunaxislu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10455340405,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACby_VdQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20otp%20field","name":"component: otp field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-15T15:39:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4827","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z"},"body":"<!-- Thanks so much for your PR, your contribution is appreciated! ❤️ -->\n\n- [X] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\n\nFixes #4828.\n\nFollow-up to #4806 and #4810.\n\n#4806 added a locked-state guard to OTP Field's hidden autofill input, but when the component is wrapped in `Field.Root`, the merged Field validation `onChange` can still run after the OTP Field handler returns. This can clear existing Form errors or commit validation while the field is `readOnly` or `disabled`.\n\nThis PR calls `event.preventBaseUIHandler?.()` before returning from the locked hidden-input autofill path, matching the Select, Combobox, and NumberField handling from #4810.\n\nThe tests now cover the locked-state matrix for hidden-input autofill:\n\n- `readOnly` / `disabled`\n- inside `Field.Root` / outside `Field.Root`\n\nThe outside-Field cases keep asserting that OTP Field public callbacks are not called. The inside-Field cases additionally assert that existing `Field.Error` content is preserved.\n\nVerified with:\n\n- `pnpm test:jsdom OTPField --no-watch`\n- `pnpm typescript`\n","closed_by":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}